WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.729
Welcome to Cybersecurity Awareness. Your phone holds your money, messages and accounts.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:11.204
Criminals want your money: mobile money, bank accounts and airtime.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.875
They want your accounts, like WhatsApp, to trick your friends and family.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:21.819
Most attacks don't need clever hacking. They trick people into sharing codes or clicking links.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:26.333
The good news: a few simple habits stop most attacks.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:36.249
Before you move on, check: List three valuable things on your phone. Name two common ways attacks happen. Commit to finishing the security checklist.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.183
In the next lesson: Passwords and 2-step verification.
